
--- [GIAI CHI TIET] PHEP CONG ---
Buoc 1: Chuyen doi chuoi bit thanh da thuc tren GF(2):
  A = x^8 + x^7 + x^6 + x^2 + x + 1
  B = x^8 + x^6 + x^4 + x^2 + 1
Buoc 2: Thuc hien phep toan:
  Ket qua A + B = x^7 + x^4 + x
Buoc 3: Ket qua he Nhi phan: 010010010

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] PHEP NHAN ---
Buoc 1: Chuyen doi chuoi bit thanh da thuc tren GF(2):
  A = x^5 + x^3 + x^2 + 1
  B = x^2 + x + 1
Buoc 2: Thuc hien phep toan:
  Ket qua A * B = x^7 + x^6 + x + 1
Buoc 3: Ket qua he Nhi phan: 11000011

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] PHEP CHIA LAY THUONG ---
Buoc 1: Chuyen doi chuoi bit thanh da thuc tren GF(2):
  A = x^6 + x^5 + x^3 + x + 1
  B = x^3 + x + 1
Buoc 2: Thuc hien phep toan:
  Ket qua A / B = x^3 + x^2 + x + 1
Buoc 3: Ket qua he Nhi phan: 1111

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] PHEP CHIA LAY DU ---
Buoc 1: Chuyen doi chuoi bit thanh da thuc tren GF(2):
  A = x^6 + x^5 + x^3 + x + 1
  B = x^3 + x + 1
Buoc 2: Thuc hien phep toan:
  Ket qua A % B = x
Buoc 3: Ket qua he Nhi phan: 10

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] KIEM TRA DA THUC TOI GIAN ---
Da thuc can kiem tra: f(x) = x^5 + x^2 + 1
Ap dung thuat toan Ben-Or test tren GF(2)...
Ket luan: f(x) LA da thuc bat kha quy.

--- [GIAI CHI TIET] SINH DA THUC TOI GIAN BAC 4 ---
Cac da thuc thoa man (dang nhi phan va toan hoc):
 + 10011 (x^4 + x + 1)
 + 11001 (x^4 + x^3 + 1)
 + 11111 (x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + x + 1)
